Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:57:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 47/47] metal: drop superseded R2C probe and debug scaffolding

Direct vkFFT R2C (useMergeSequences path) produced a systematic layout
mismatch; the Hermitian expansion + c2c path supersedes it (8e-08 CPU,
5e-07 GPU). Keeps the meaningful gates: peak, c2c, forward, expand-gpu.

